  "failure_policy": "One attempt per frozen stage; fail closed. Preserve logs and partial outputs. A repair requires a new GitHub source SHA and a new repo-batch44c*-tested directory.",
  "test_policy": "The 11 DEV and 10 TEST sequences are collection-group disjoint and were unused in Batch43; the same groups are reused only to repair Batch44B, which did not score TEST. Query initialization uses the same predeclared earliest-common-visible-depth-snapshot rule in both splits; this only defines a valid initial tracking query. Only DEV selects cross-view methods/thresholds or admits the VLM. TEST predictions are pinned before one-time TEST scoring; no TEST-derived threshold, prompt, parser or method changes are permitted.",
